# Licensed BADA 4 approach bank/load REPORT and ENFORCE gate.
# Run with: IC research/pybada-envelope-approach
00:00:00.00>ECHO TEST INFO === PYBADATEM APPROACH LATERAL ENVELOPE GATE ===
00:00:00.05>ECHO TEST INFO This gate uses the previously observed PYBADA approach operating point.
00:00:00.10>ECHO TEST EXPECT Both aircraft report config AP, HLid 3, gear up, DLM nf3/nf1, and bank maximum near 60 degrees.
00:00:00.15>ECHO TEST ERROR Stop if either aircraft does not expose that approach configuration before the turn.
00:00:00.20>PLUGIN LOAD PYBADATEM
00:00:00.25>PLUGIN LOAD RESEARCHRECORDER
00:00:00.30>PERFMODEL BADA4
00:00:01.00>CRE APPR,A320-232,41.30,2.10,90,5000,180
00:00:01.10>CRE APPE,A320-232,41.32,2.10,90,5000,180
00:00:01.20>DYNAMICS APPR KINEMATIC
00:00:01.30>DYNAMICS APPE KINEMATIC
00:00:01.40>BADACONFIG APPR PYBADA
00:00:01.50>BADACONFIG APPE PYBADA
00:00:01.60>ALT APPR 1000 -1000
00:00:01.70>ALT APPE 1000 -1000
00:00:01.80>PAN 41.31 2.10
00:00:01.90>ZOOM 20
00:00:02.00>TRAIL ON 0.20
00:00:02.10>TRAIL APPR RED
00:00:02.20>TRAIL APPE BLUE
00:00:02.30>BANK APPR 70
00:00:02.40>BANK APPE 70
00:00:02.50>ENVELOPECHECKS APPR CUSTOM BANK_ANGLE LOAD_FACTOR
00:00:02.60>ENVELOPECHECKS APPE CUSTOM BANK_ANGLE LOAD_FACTOR
00:00:02.70>ENVELOPE APPR REPORT
00:00:02.80>ENVELOPE APPE ENFORCE
00:00:02.90>RECORDRESEARCH START pybada-envelope-approach.csv
00:00:03.00>PERFSTATUS APPR BOUNDS
00:00:03.10>PERFSTATUS APPE BOUNDS
00:00:03.20>ECHO TEST EXPECT No QUALITY event yet because effective bank is zero outside a turn.
00:00:04.00>ECHO TEST ACTION Commanding both aircraft from heading 90 to 270 with a requested 70-degree bank.
00:00:04.05>ECHO TEST EXPECT APPR REPORT keeps about 70 degrees and coordinated load about 2.924.
00:00:04.10>ECHO TEST EXPECT APPE ENFORCE limits near 60 degrees and load 2.000.
00:00:04.20>HDG APPR 270
00:00:04.30>HDG APPE 270
00:00:08.00>PERFSTATUS APPR ALL
00:00:08.10>PERFSTATUS APPE ALL
00:00:08.20>RECORDRESEARCH STOP
00:00:08.30>ECHO TEST INFO Run validate_approach_lateral_run.py on output/pybada-envelope-approach.csv.
00:00:25.00>ECHO TEST EXPECT The red REPORT trail has a tighter radius than the blue ENFORCE trail.
00:00:28.00>HOLD
